Name: Scatter
Description: Draw a scatter plot and insert code that loads the drawn points.
Binding: dcr_scatter_addin
Interactive: true

Name: Boxplot
Description: Draw boxplots and insert code that samples data matching them.
Binding: dcr_boxplot_addin
Interactive: true

Name: Histogram
Description: Draw histograms and insert code that samples data matching them.
Binding: dcr_histogram_addin
Interactive: true

Name: Count
Description: Draw count bars and insert code that loads exactly those counts.
Binding: dcr_count_addin
Interactive: true

Name: Density
Description: Density Curve Data Generator
Binding: dcr_density_addin
Interactive: true

Name: Bivariate normal
Description: Draw bivariate normal populations and insert code to sample them
Binding: dcr_bivariate_addin
Interactive: true

Name: Mosaic (contingency table)
Description: Draw an exact two-way contingency table and insert code to load it
Binding: dcr_mosaic_addin
Interactive: true

Name: Regression curve
Description: Draw a regression curve with its error band and insert code to sample it
Binding: dcr_regression_addin
Interactive: true
